Rather than making it impossible to kill the shopkeeper or steal , it
should just be extremely difficult ... then the keeper is another 
challenge for high level characters.

To make it sufficently difficult , how about the following
 i) the shop is in an anti-magic vault...no magic , wands etc. will work
	there , and all weapons , armour etc. will count as +0
 ii)the shopkeeper has a couple of exceptionally powerful pets ... probably
	trolls , which act as guards.
 iii) how about a security alarmed door ... it shuts automatically whenever
	an unpaid object approaches. "You hear a siren sound. The door closes.
	The troll bites. The troll hits." etc.

This would allow sufficiently powerful characters to have a little extra
challenge , without just zapping a wand of death and then stealing everything.

Of course , being the black market , you'd expect it to deal in the typical 
sort of stuff for there .... drugs (hallucinogen , booze) , weapons (if it's
that far down , what sort of weapons *do* the locals use to take care of 
themselves ... the mind boggles) , stolen gems/credit cards , cheap designer
label Hawaian shirts....

To implement the anti-magic thing , maybe the floor needs to be ^^^^ all
anti-magic traps ...  would this stop teleport???

Of course , the trolls should bash any pet that tried to escape the store
as well , if it was carrying unpaid items.

